Hello,

The Crypto.com Onchain Desktop application is now available. This release b=
rings the full power of the Onchain ecosystem directly to your computer, gi=
ving you a larger canvas to manage your assets across multiple chains.

We built the desktop experience with three major additions to keep you in c=
ontrol. Advanced Scam Detection automatically checks supported dapp connect=
ions and surfaces clear risk signals before you proceed. Hardware Wallet Co=
mpatibility lets you connect supported Ledger devices to sign transactions =
while keeping your private keys offline. Finally, Built-in AI integrates ma=
rket signals and token context directly into your view.

It is the same self-custodial foundation you trust, expanded for the deskto=
p.

Download Onchain Desktop <https://onchain-desktop.com/download/> =20

Download the official release today to review the supported operating syste=
ms and get started.

Security Approach: Self-custody, supports hardware wallet signing, and dapp=
 connection risk checks.

________________________________

Stay secure. Stay Onchain.

Regards,

The Crypto.com Onchain Team

Onchain Wallet Limited

